{"id":"twitter:1883215930731491517","tweet_id":"1883215930731491517","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883215930731491517","title":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat No court is really touching the fundamental privacy rights. Focus has been on whether Government can request benefactor data, ","summary":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat No court is really touching the fundamental privacy rights. Focus has been on whether Government can request benefactor data, and punish companies for not providing said data, under the Commerce Clause. Defendants were chosen specifically for not doing inter-state commerce","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T18:10:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883206363729494478","reply_tweet_id":"1883206363729494478","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat No court is really touching the fundamental privacy rights.<br><br> Focus has been on whether  Government can request benefactor data, and punish companies for not providing said data, under the Commerce Clause.<br><br>Defendants were chosen specifically for not doing inter-state commerce</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883215930731491517","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 18:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1883207017940332780","tweet_id":"1883207017940332780","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883207017940332780","title":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat I don't buy the Muslim connection to Oklahoma City. Dana Rohrabacher was big into those. I think he even interviewed McVeigh a","summary":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat I don't buy the Muslim connection to Oklahoma City. Dana Rohrabacher was big into those. I think he even interviewed McVeigh and did a report. Was there always influence campaigns in White Power acceleration? I 100% think so since 1984ish, to what degree? We will never know","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T17:35:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883206363729494478","reply_tweet_id":"1883206363729494478","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat I don&#x27;t buy the Muslim connection to Oklahoma City. <br><br>Dana Rohrabacher was big into those. I think he even interviewed McVeigh and did a report.<br><br>Was there always influence campaigns in White Power acceleration? I 100% think so since 1984ish, to what degree? We will never know</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883207017940332780","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 17:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1883206363729494478","tweet_id":"1883206363729494478","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883206363729494478","title":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat To me, isn't a free speech violation to make companies identify a benefactor. NSBU vs Yellen and Top Cop vs Garland use same l","summary":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat To me, isn't a free speech violation to make companies identify a benefactor. NSBU vs Yellen and Top Cop vs Garland use same legal arguments. Top Cop vs Garland is more about District judges ability to declare injunctions NSBU vs Yellen is in 11th, but will Trump pursue?","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T17:32:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ReceiptsIn/status/1883205323538010419","reply_tweet_id":"1883205323538010419","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat To me, isn&#x27;t a free speech violation to make companies identify a benefactor.<br><br>NSBU vs Yellen and Top Cop vs Garland use same legal arguments.<br><br>Top Cop vs Garland is more about District judges ability to declare injunctions<br><br>NSBU vs Yellen is in 11th, but will Trump pursue?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883206363729494478","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 17:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
