{"id":"twitter:1883202233309016362","tweet_id":"1883202233309016362","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883202233309016362","title":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat This was the OG mistake. The anti-money laundering parts of Patriot Act were \"temporarily\" suspended forever. Watch NSBU v. Ye","summary":"@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat This was the OG mistake. The anti-money laundering parts of Patriot Act were \"temporarily\" suspended forever. Watch NSBU v. Yellen. This is about the Corporate Transparency Act and the Commerce Clause https://t.co/RNozyi7PRJ","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T17:16:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ReceiptsIn/status/1883201061923733683","reply_tweet_id":"1883201061923733683","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ReceiptsIn @CombatBeat This was the OG mistake. <br><br>The anti-money laundering parts of Patriot Act were &quot;temporarily&quot; suspended forever.<br><br>Watch NSBU v. Yellen. This is about the Corporate Transparency Act and the Commerce Clause <a href=\"https://t.co/RNozyi7PRJ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/RNozyi7PRJ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a51578a749e05275187c0f35407ef4ee.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883202233309016362","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 17:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a51578a749e05275187c0f35407ef4ee.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1883201336956895336","tweet_id":"1883201336956895336","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883201336956895336","title":"An ember burns signing hues of radiance cackling in consequences singing an ending or beginning. How will you hold your flame? #smallpoems","summary":"An ember burns signing hues of radiance cackling in consequences singing an ending or beginning. How will you hold your flame? #smallpoems","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T17:12:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>An ember <br>burns<br>signing <br>hues of <br>radiance<br>cackling in <br>consequences<br>singing an ending <br> or beginning.<br>How will you hold <br>your<br> flame?<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883201336956895336","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 17:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1883191881930264759","tweet_id":"1883191881930264759","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883191881930264759","title":"@geyanastasio On New Year's 2000 we were at the Warfield and the Parking Garage across the Street closed before the show got out. Had to spend 3.00 fo","summary":"@geyanastasio On New Year's 2000 we were at the Warfield and the Parking Garage across the Street closed before the show got out. Had to spend 3.00 for a BART ticket and sleep on the train going back in forth. Cheapest hotel room I ever found in San Fransisco","date":"2025-01-25","published":"2025-01-25T16:35:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/geyanastasio/status/1883190520677351905","reply_tweet_id":"1883190520677351905","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@geyanastasio On New Year&#x27;s 2000 we were at the Warfield and the Parking Garage across the Street closed before the show got out.<br><br>Had to spend 3.00 for a BART ticket and sleep on the train going back in forth.<br><br>Cheapest hotel room I ever found in San Fransisco</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883191881930264759","display_date":"January 25, 2025 · 16:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
