{"id":"twitter:1882450101689573693","tweet_id":"1882450101689573693","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1882450101689573693","title":"@exileoftza I was using chudnik, but that was before I knew about the etymologogical links to Ugro-Finnic tribes, and other people usually on the rece","summary":"@exileoftza I was using chudnik, but that was before I knew about the etymologogical links to Ugro-Finnic tribes, and other people usually on the receiving end of russian nonsense. Not sure if I can now. #NerdReich works too, but will play with words.","date":"2025-01-23","published":"2025-01-23T15:27:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/exileoftza/status/1882435100744548771","reply_tweet_id":"1882435100744548771","tags":["NerdReich"],"body_html":"<p>@exileoftza I was using chudnik, but that was before I knew about the etymologogical links to Ugro-Finnic tribes, and other people usually on the receiving end of russian nonsense.<br><br>Not sure if I can now. <br><br>#NerdReich works too, but will play with words.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1882450101689573693","display_date":"January 23, 2025 · 15:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
