{"id":"twitter:1882418116367720793","tweet_id":"1882418116367720793","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1882418116367720793","title":"I am honestly okay with most non-violent J6ers getting pardoned. I agree with Jefferson. Most were driven by ignorance and false gazetteers. But Jeffe","summary":"I am honestly okay with most non-violent J6ers getting pardoned. I agree with Jefferson. Most were driven by ignorance and false gazetteers. But Jefferson also called for rioters to be \"set right with the truth\" AND pardoned. We can't skip that step. That's an important step.","date":"2025-01-23","published":"2025-01-23T13:20:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I am honestly okay with most non-violent J6ers getting pardoned. I agree with Jefferson. Most were driven by ignorance and false gazetteers.<br><br>But Jefferson also called for rioters to be &quot;set right with the truth&quot; AND pardoned.<br><br>We can&#x27;t skip that step. That&#x27;s an important step.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1882418116367720793","display_date":"January 23, 2025 · 13:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
