{"id":"twitter:2048042138097590645","tweet_id":"2048042138097590645","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2048042138097590645","title":"In the afterword the title translation is explained “Why a collective farm and not a farm?..” Ihor Shevchenko, under the pseudonym, contacted Orwell. ","summary":"In the afterword the title translation is explained “Why a collective farm and not a farm?..” Ihor Shevchenko, under the pseudonym, contacted Orwell. Orwell gladly agreed to write a special preface to the Ukrainian edition, free of charge","date":"2026-04-25","published":"2026-04-25T14:11:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048041504631906602","reply_tweet_id":"2048041504631906602","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In the afterword the title translation is explained<br><br>“Why a collective farm and not a farm?..”<br><br>Ihor Shevchenko, under the pseudonym, contacted Orwell. Orwell gladly agreed to write a special preface to the Ukrainian edition, free of charge</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048042138097590645","display_date":"April 25, 2026 · 14:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
