{"id":"twitter:2048021974786396204","tweet_id":"2048021974786396204","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2048021974786396204","title":"@serhii_rieznik 3D shading to capture the bevel will be a new challenge. Each piece I do is uniquely shaped by a lack of talent. Having some coffee, a","summary":"@serhii_rieznik 3D shading to capture the bevel will be a new challenge. Each piece I do is uniquely shaped by a lack of talent. Having some coffee, and taking part in Wikipedia's Ukrainian Cultural Heritage Month. Sentences or shading, always tough lines with a little color. https://t.co/W4I8RpWrIu","date":"2026-04-25","published":"2026-04-25T12:51:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/serhii_rieznik/status/2048020956002574777","reply_tweet_id":"2048020956002574777","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@serhii_rieznik 3D shading to capture the bevel will be a new challenge. Each piece I do is uniquely shaped by a lack of talent.<br><br>Having some coffee, and taking part in Wikipedia&#x27;s Ukrainian Cultural Heritage Month.<br><br>Sentences or shading, always tough lines with a little color. <a href=\"https://t.co/W4I8RpWrIu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/W4I8RpWrIu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4b67a7b6974cc22b49f30fc5b47fcd85.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048021974786396204","display_date":"April 25, 2026 · 12:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4b67a7b6974cc22b49f30fc5b47fcd85.jpg"]}
