{"id":"twitter:1881754948989509892","tweet_id":"1881754948989509892","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1881754948989509892","title":"@ImposeCost I wonder if the the CUI FAR rule is now paused, given https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/01/regulatory-freeze-pending-re","summary":"@ImposeCost I wonder if the the CUI FAR rule is now paused, given https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/01/regulatory-freeze-pending-review/ How the FAR rule turns out have massive impact on Cyber. Vought can exempt the rule, but Ratcliffe was never a fan of the CUI rule in the first place (and Obama did it, which adds vulnerability)","date":"2025-01-21","published":"2025-01-21T17:25:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ImposeCost/status/1881541781978042694","reply_tweet_id":"1881541781978042694","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ImposeCost I wonder if the the CUI FAR rule is now paused, given <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/01/regulatory-freeze-pending-review/\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/01/regulatory-freeze-pending-review/</a><br><br>How the FAR rule turns out have massive impact on Cyber.<br><br>Vought can exempt the rule, but Ratcliffe was never a fan of the CUI rule in the first place (and Obama did it, which adds vulnerability)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1881754948989509892","display_date":"January 21, 2025 · 17:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
