{"id":"twitter:1881680007644541244","tweet_id":"1881680007644541244","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1881680007644541244","title":"@aprilsparkles1 @sarcastic_spell It isn't helpful to Ukraine, the reality is very bad for Ukraine. Assume Ukraine won't get one dollar from Trump, and","summary":"@aprilsparkles1 @sarcastic_spell It isn't helpful to Ukraine, the reality is very bad for Ukraine. Assume Ukraine won't get one dollar from Trump, and plan accordingly Vought is on record that they will challenge the idea a President must spend all funds allocated by Congress. https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/15/business/russell-vought-budget-office-confirmat","date":"2025-01-21","published":"2025-01-21T12:27:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/aprilsparkles1/status/1881678882606403778","reply_tweet_id":"1881678882606403778","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@aprilsparkles1 @sarcastic_spell It isn&#x27;t helpful to Ukraine, the reality is very bad for Ukraine.<br><br>Assume Ukraine won&#x27;t get one dollar from Trump, and plan accordingly<br><br>Vought is on record that they will challenge the idea a President must spend all funds allocated by Congress.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/15/business/russell-vought-budget-office-confirmation-hearing.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.nytimes.com/2025/01/15/business/russell-vought-budget-office-confirmation-hearing.html</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1881680007644541244","display_date":"January 21, 2025 · 12:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
