{"id":"twitter:1880989892609753243","tweet_id":"1880989892609753243","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880989892609753243","title":"@hmm11960 Yes, but means for any trial you have to have endless hearings deciding was is an official act and what is an unofficial act, and which act ","summary":"@hmm11960 Yes, but means for any trial you have to have endless hearings deciding was is an official act and what is an unofficial act, and which act wasn't a presidential act It is unlimited immunity caused by unlimited delay No President can ever be held accountable for crimes, now","date":"2025-01-19","published":"2025-01-19T14:45:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/hmm11960/status/1880989336625455308","reply_tweet_id":"1880989336625455308","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@hmm11960 Yes, but  means for any trial you have to have endless hearings deciding was is an official act and what is an unofficial act, and which act wasn&#x27;t a presidential act<br><br>It is unlimited immunity caused by unlimited delay<br><br>No President can ever be held accountable for crimes, now</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880989892609753243","display_date":"January 19, 2025 · 14:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
