{"id":"twitter:1880645097639006632","tweet_id":"1880645097639006632","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880645097639006632","title":"In Soviet russia Birch being associated with world of the old estate and nostalgia while the White Birch was encouraged in landscape painters. Which b","summary":"In Soviet russia Birch being associated with world of the old estate and nostalgia while the White Birch was encouraged in landscape painters. Which brings us full circle to Kateryna Bilokur's \"Flowers and Birch Trees Did it have a double meaning? Dunno, but it's my meaning","date":"2025-01-18","published":"2025-01-18T15:55:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880644055962702334","reply_tweet_id":"1880644055962702334","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In Soviet russia Birch being associated with  world of the old estate and nostalgia while the White Birch was encouraged in landscape painters.<br><br>Which brings us full circle to Kateryna Bilokur&#x27;s &quot;Flowers and Birch Trees<br><br>Did it have a double meaning? Dunno, but it&#x27;s my meaning</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880645097639006632","display_date":"January 18, 2025 · 15:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1880644055962702334","tweet_id":"1880644055962702334","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880644055962702334","title":"You see the use of Birch Tree as a sad sad harbinger of imminent changes in much pre-revolutionary period This symbolism became dominant in people of ","summary":"You see the use of Birch Tree as a sad sad harbinger of imminent changes in much pre-revolutionary period This symbolism became dominant in people of Northwestern Europe after the 1500s and spread to Siberian tribes You see it in some early 1900 poetry","date":"2025-01-18","published":"2025-01-18T15:50:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880643480030261718","reply_tweet_id":"1880643480030261718","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You see the use of Birch Tree as a sad sad harbinger of imminent changes in much pre-revolutionary period<br><br>This symbolism became dominant in people of Northwestern Europe after the 1500s and spread to Siberian tribes<br><br>You see it in some early 1900 poetry</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880644055962702334","display_date":"January 18, 2025 · 15:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1880643480030261718","tweet_id":"1880643480030261718","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880643480030261718","title":"The idea of the Russian birch got firmly rooted in British culture through the 1800s. By the 19th Century and the coming Soviet overthrow of the last ","summary":"The idea of the Russian birch got firmly rooted in British culture through the 1800s. By the 19th Century and the coming Soviet overthrow of the last Tsar, the Birch came to symbolize protecting the rural world and the \"noble russian serf\"","date":"2025-01-18","published":"2025-01-18T15:48:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880642496335892990","reply_tweet_id":"1880642496335892990","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The idea of the Russian birch got  firmly rooted in British culture through the 1800s.<br><br>By the 19th Century and the coming Soviet overthrow of the last Tsar, the Birch came to symbolize protecting the rural world and the &quot;noble russian serf&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880643480030261718","display_date":"January 18, 2025 · 15:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
