{"id":"twitter:1880378123063291918","tweet_id":"1880378123063291918","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880378123063291918","title":"Pushkin cemented the Birch Tree in his poetry and folklore collections. A form of poetry emerged which Western diplomats andoften dismissed as \"estate","summary":"Pushkin cemented the Birch Tree in his poetry and folklore collections. A form of poetry emerged which Western diplomats andoften dismissed as \"estate poetry\" there was this idea of nostalgic countryside, but on vast wealthy estates...everybody wrote about birch trees","date":"2025-01-17","published":"2025-01-17T22:14:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880377327277977796","reply_tweet_id":"1880377327277977796","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Pushkin cemented the Birch Tree in his poetry and folklore collections.<br><br>A form of poetry emerged which Western diplomats andoften dismissed as &quot;estate poetry&quot;<br><br>there was this idea of nostalgic countryside, but on vast wealthy estates...everybody wrote about birch trees</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880378123063291918","display_date":"January 17, 2025 · 22:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1880377327277977796","tweet_id":"1880377327277977796","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880377327277977796","title":"Trees did spread literally with the Empire. When Catherine the Great died, serfs were planted rows of Birch Trees along what would become the tran-sib","summary":"Trees did spread literally with the Empire. When Catherine the Great died, serfs were planted rows of Birch Trees along what would become the tran-siberian railroad. Potemkin had Birch groves planted as symbols of russian power in many of the Empire's newly conquered lands","date":"2025-01-17","published":"2025-01-17T22:11:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880376826360697200","reply_tweet_id":"1880376826360697200","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Trees  did spread literally with the Empire. When Catherine the Great died, serfs were planted rows of Birch Trees along what would become the tran-siberian railroad.<br><br>Potemkin had Birch groves planted as symbols of russian power in many of the Empire&#x27;s newly conquered lands</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880377327277977796","display_date":"January 17, 2025 · 22:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1880376826360697200","tweet_id":"1880376826360697200","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880376826360697200","title":"As the Birch Tree grew into a symbol of russian empire. We also see the transition of the Birch Tree into a warning in the indigenous people of Northw","summary":"As the Birch Tree grew into a symbol of russian empire. We also see the transition of the Birch Tree into a warning in the indigenous people of Northwest russia and Siberia Appearance of a White Birch was an omen the \"white faces\" were coming and it was time to leave your land","date":"2025-01-17","published":"2025-01-17T22:09:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880376070064554221","reply_tweet_id":"1880376070064554221","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>As the Birch Tree grew into a symbol of russian empire. We also see the transition of the Birch Tree into a warning in the indigenous people of Northwest russia and Siberia<br><br>Appearance of a White Birch  was an omen the &quot;white faces&quot; were coming and it was time to leave your land</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880376826360697200","display_date":"January 17, 2025 · 22:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
