{"id":"twitter:1880316262703907118","tweet_id":"1880316262703907118","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880316262703907118","title":"Top Cop vs Garland is a case moving through 5th Circuit. That could actually end up limiting District Court's ability at blanket National injunctions.","summary":"Top Cop vs Garland is a case moving through 5th Circuit. That could actually end up limiting District Court's ability at blanket National injunctions. Commerce Clause stuff will eventually reach Supreme Court after NSBA vs Yellen finishes in 11th. Nobody's asking about this","date":"2025-01-17","published":"2025-01-17T18:08:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880309740426916065","reply_tweet_id":"1880309740426916065","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Top Cop vs Garland is a case moving through 5th Circuit. That could actually end up limiting District Court&#x27;s ability at blanket National injunctions.<br><br>Commerce Clause stuff will eventually reach Supreme Court after NSBA vs Yellen finishes in 11th.<br><br>Nobody&#x27;s asking about this</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880316262703907118","display_date":"January 17, 2025 · 18:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1880315448560087394","tweet_id":"1880315448560087394","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1880315448560087394","title":"@TripleDDD1409 We get lots of cool science, unrelated to space, from our space program. I see this as the dangers of privatizing space, paid for by th","summary":"@TripleDDD1409 We get lots of cool science, unrelated to space, from our space program. I see this as the dangers of privatizing space, paid for by the folks who paid hundreds of millions to make sure we didn't talk about climate change. Why save Earth if you can wreck Mars?","date":"2025-01-17","published":"2025-01-17T18:05:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TripleDDD1409/status/1880314405520568827","reply_tweet_id":"1880314405520568827","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TripleDDD1409 We get lots of cool science, unrelated to space, from our space program.<br><br>I see this as the dangers of privatizing space, paid for by the folks who paid hundreds of millions to make sure we didn&#x27;t talk about climate change.<br><br>Why save Earth if you can wreck Mars?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1880315448560087394","display_date":"January 17, 2025 · 18:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
