{"id":"twitter:1879936778679058625","tweet_id":"1879936778679058625","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1879936778679058625","title":"It is worth noting that the Northern Crusades were the last forceful Christianizations in Europe and the Baltic and Finnish people the last to hold on","summary":"It is worth noting that the Northern Crusades were the last forceful Christianizations in Europe and the Baltic and Finnish people the last to hold on to the Old Gods. Forced Christendom would still be occurring in Asia and the Americas well into the 19th and even 20th century https://t.co/YYPgJYkUru","date":"2025-01-16","published":"2025-01-16T17:00:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It is worth noting that the Northern Crusades were the last forceful Christianizations in Europe and the Baltic and Finnish people the last to hold on to the Old Gods.<br><br>Forced Christendom would still be occurring in Asia and the Americas well into the 19th and even 20th century <a href=\"https://t.co/YYPgJYkUru\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/YYPgJYkUru</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/557f439c430dd4bdfad5df43f08fa700.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1879936778679058625","display_date":"January 16, 2025 · 17:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/557f439c430dd4bdfad5df43f08fa700.jpg"]}
