{"id":"twitter:2047856542003732648","tweet_id":"2047856542003732648","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2047856542003732648","title":"@laytham @JamesSurowiecki Traditional EW countermeasures don't work on fiber optic drones. A shotgun and a prayer is often a soldiers last line of Def","summary":"@laytham @JamesSurowiecki Traditional EW countermeasures don't work on fiber optic drones. A shotgun and a prayer is often a soldiers last line of Defense on the Battlefield. That's what I see watching this.","date":"2026-04-25","published":"2026-04-25T01:53:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/laytham/status/2047853590757404780","reply_tweet_id":"2047853590757404780","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@laytham @JamesSurowiecki Traditional EW countermeasures don&#x27;t work on fiber optic drones.<br><br>A shotgun and a prayer is often a soldiers last line of Defense on the Battlefield.<br><br>That&#x27;s what I see watching this.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2047856542003732648","display_date":"April 25, 2026 · 01:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2047856181356495239","tweet_id":"2047856181356495239","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2047856181356495239","title":"@JamesSurowiecki Or drones if you are Infantry and snipers. We do shotgun fundraisers all the time. Being able to stow the last line of FPV defense wi","summary":"@JamesSurowiecki Or drones if you are Infantry and snipers. We do shotgun fundraisers all the time. Being able to stow the last line of FPV defense without weighing down your primary weapon would be huge. In the next few years we will see more and more shotguns as part of the standard kit.","date":"2026-04-25","published":"2026-04-25T01:52:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JamesSurowiecki/status/2047851361484652940","reply_tweet_id":"2047851361484652940","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JamesSurowiecki Or drones if you are Infantry and snipers. We do shotgun fundraisers all the time.<br><br>Being able to stow the last line of FPV defense without weighing down your primary weapon would be huge.<br><br>In the next few years we will see more and more shotguns as part of the standard kit.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2047856181356495239","display_date":"April 25, 2026 · 01:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
