{"id":"twitter:1879523165959032997","tweet_id":"1879523165959032997","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1879523165959032997","title":"@Pin__Terest Maybe, C2M2, the DOE's version very similar, but has more CMMI vibes (like CMMC 1.0) CMMC is just a program for third party assessment. F","summary":"@Pin__Terest Maybe, C2M2, the DOE's version very similar, but has more CMMI vibes (like CMMC 1.0) CMMC is just a program for third party assessment. FAR 21 does layout 17 requirements across 15 controls all contractors must meet For CMMC this is still self-attestation, so it could work","date":"2025-01-15","published":"2025-01-15T13:36:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Pin__Terest/status/1879522455896924648","reply_tweet_id":"1879522455896924648","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Pin__Terest Maybe,<br><br>C2M2, the DOE&#x27;s version very similar, but has more CMMI vibes (like CMMC 1.0)<br><br>CMMC is just a program for third party assessment.<br><br>FAR 21 does layout 17 requirements across 15 controls all contractors must meet<br><br>For CMMC this is still self-attestation, so it could work</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1879523165959032997","display_date":"January 15, 2025 · 13:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
