{"id":"twitter:1879154842498920833","tweet_id":"1879154842498920833","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1879154842498920833","title":"If there was no Insurrection how come people are in jail for violating U.S.C. 2383.? By definition there was an insurrection if people are in prison f","summary":"If there was no Insurrection how come people are in jail for violating U.S.C. 2383.? By definition there was an insurrection if people are in prison for committing an insurrection https://x.com/HSkether/status/1879147080972931164","date":"2025-01-14","published":"2025-01-14T13:13:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>If there was no Insurrection how come people are in jail for violating U.S.C. 2383.?<br><br>By definition there was an insurrection if people are in prison for committing an insurrection <a href=\"https://x.com/HSkether/status/1879147080972931164\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/HSkether/status/1879147080972931164</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1879154842498920833","display_date":"January 14, 2025 · 13:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1879154568589979892","tweet_id":"1879154568589979892","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1879154568589979892","title":"@jonkessler20 18 U.S.C. 2383 does not define an insurrection. You have to show willing intent to rebel against the country. Jack Smith felt he did not","summary":"@jonkessler20 18 U.S.C. 2383 does not define an insurrection. You have to show willing intent to rebel against the country. Jack Smith felt he did not have enough evidence to charge Trump with any violations of 2383. I think DoJ just wanted to avoid a 14th amendment fight","date":"2025-01-14","published":"2025-01-14T13:12:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jonkessler20/status/1879145661901484332","reply_tweet_id":"1879145661901484332","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jonkessler20 18 U.S.C. 2383 does not define an insurrection. You have to show willing intent to rebel against the country.<br><br>Jack Smith felt he did not have enough evidence to charge Trump with any violations of 2383.<br><br>I think DoJ just wanted to avoid a 14th amendment fight</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1879154568589979892","display_date":"January 14, 2025 · 13:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
