{"id":"twitter:1878179173186814243","tweet_id":"1878179173186814243","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1878179173186814243","title":"@dianesbaker1 Here is study, Don't think it was ever peer reviewed, GTO's are a \"pilot\" about ending a \"temporary\" loop-hole added to in the Patriot A","summary":"@dianesbaker1 Here is study, Don't think it was ever peer reviewed, GTO's are a \"pilot\" about ending a \"temporary\" loop-hole added to in the Patriot Act back in 2002. Sanctions were also dropping during the the same time period. so normal, correlation not causation https://www.richmondfed.org/-/media/richmondfedorg/banking/qsr-people/qsr_events/opriskconfere","date":"2025-01-11","published":"2025-01-11T20:36:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1878175721291690340","reply_tweet_id":"1878175721291690340","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 Here is study, Don&#x27;t think it was ever peer reviewed, GTO&#x27;s are a &quot;pilot&quot; about ending a &quot;temporary&quot; loop-hole added to in the Patriot Act back in 2002.<br><br>Sanctions were also dropping during the the same time period. so normal, correlation not causation<br> <a href=\"https://www.richmondfed.org/-/media/richmondfedorg/banking/qsr-people/qsr_events/opriskconference2018/9a_hundtofte_presentation_anonymuscapitalflows.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.richmondfed.org/-/media/richmondfedorg/banking/qsr-people/qsr_events/opriskconference2018/9a_hundtofte_presentation_anonymuscapitalflows.pdf</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/G2a8nO6P0L\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/G2a8nO6P0L</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8a24f7faa5f0feabc8639f410d79d876.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/310c89ff5d73338839e4709d71182d4d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/stat