{"id":"twitter:1877411827811787096","tweet_id":"1877411827811787096","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1877411827811787096","title":"Why was Joe Biden targeted? Some masterful long planned takeover? No, it was pettiness. Dimitry Firtash blamed Joe Biden for Austria putting Firtash u","summary":"Why was Joe Biden targeted? Some masterful long planned takeover? No, it was pettiness. Dimitry Firtash blamed Joe Biden for Austria putting Firtash under House arrest in 2014. Firtash did call his buddy Paul Manafort, next. The rest is history","date":"2025-01-09","published":"2025-01-09T17:47:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Why was Joe Biden targeted? Some masterful long planned takeover?<br><br>No, it was pettiness.<br><br>Dimitry Firtash blamed Joe Biden for Austria putting Firtash under House arrest in 2014.<br><br>Firtash did call his buddy Paul Manafort, next. <br><br>The rest is history</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877411827811787096","display_date":"January 09, 2025 · 17:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
