{"id":"twitter:1877404489725976680","tweet_id":"1877404489725976680","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1877404489725976680","title":"A Sales agent may not know that answer, and asking Sales folks deeply technical questions about encryption is kinda mean. But they should know how to ","summary":"A Sales agent may not know that answer, and asking Sales folks deeply technical questions about encryption is kinda mean. But they should know how to get the answer to either a security or technical question. I wanna know if they can do that, then check if it's the right one","date":"2025-01-09","published":"2025-01-09T17:18:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877404100934930639","reply_tweet_id":"1877404100934930639","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A Sales agent may not know that answer, and asking Sales folks deeply technical questions about encryption is kinda mean.<br><br>But they should know how to get the answer to either a security or technical question.<br><br>I wanna know if they can do that, then check if it&#x27;s the right one</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877404489725976680","display_date":"January 09, 2025 · 17:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1877404100934930639","tweet_id":"1877404100934930639","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1877404100934930639","title":"When a sales agent or direct marketing campaign hits you with \"military grade encryption\" the follow up question should be, \" How many security requir","summary":"When a sales agent or direct marketing campaign hits you with \"military grade encryption\" the follow up question should be, \" How many security requirements would your tool hit on Federal systems\" If they don't know the answer, you wouldn't use the company, regardless","date":"2025-01-09","published":"2025-01-09T17:16:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>When a sales agent or direct marketing campaign hits you with<br><br>&quot;military grade encryption&quot;<br><br>the follow up question should be, &quot; How many security requirements would your tool hit on Federal systems&quot;<br><br>If they don&#x27;t know the answer, you wouldn&#x27;t use the company, regardless</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877404100934930639","display_date":"January 09, 2025 · 17:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
