{"id":"twitter:1877172508887228606","tweet_id":"1877172508887228606","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1877172508887228606","title":"Hums strum where our ancients dwell for the fifth molt leaps forward Stridulation as we dance together My legs rooted in hime to let far away wings si","summary":"Hums strum where our ancients dwell for the fifth molt leaps forward Stridulation as we dance together My legs rooted in hime to let far away wings sing to fill concert halls carved in Buran-Kaya caves Soon songs we adore will blossom from mountain floors for our new swarm… https://t.co/nHMO3OwjXo","date":"2025-01-09","published":"2025-01-09T01:56:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877171658554835010","reply_tweet_id":"1877171658554835010","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hums strum where our<br>ancients dwell<br>for the fifth molt<br>leaps forward<br><br>Stridulation<br>as we dance together<br>My legs rooted in hime<br>to let far away wings sing<br>to fill concert halls<br>carved in Buran-Kaya caves<br><br>Soon<br>songs we adore<br>will blossom from <br>mountain floors<br>for our new swarm… <a href=\"https://t.co/nHMO3OwjXo\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nHMO3OwjXo</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f3c08d73e5b4e34f18e9cbc8ce6c6ed7.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877172508887228606","display_date":"January 09, 2025 · 01:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f3c08d73e5b4e34f18e9cbc8ce6c6ed7.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1877171658554835010","tweet_id":"1877171658554835010","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1877171658554835010","title":"Tucked in Alpine Meadows Songs slip on crick beds And sun glistens in Sounds of Stone Grasshoppers that Shall never fall silent As they seek destiny o","summary":"Tucked in Alpine Meadows Songs slip on crick beds And sun glistens in Sounds of Stone Grasshoppers that Shall never fall silent As they seek destiny on The Alma Our range We call home keeping time by rasping heaven's door. 1/2 #smallpoems https://t.co/vOINSRBdxk","date":"2025-01-09","published":"2025-01-09T01:52:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Tucked in <br>Alpine Meadows<br>Songs slip on crick beds<br>And sun glistens in<br>Sounds of Stone Grasshoppers that<br>Shall never fall silent<br>As they seek destiny on<br>The Alma<br>Our range<br>We call home<br>keeping time by rasping heaven&#x27;s<br>door.<br>1/2<br>#smallpoems <a href=\"https://t.co/vOINSRBdxk\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/vOINSRBdxk</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a02710d804a5b0af7e54a761891e7712.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1877171658554835010","display_date":"January 09, 2025 · 01:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a02710d804a5b0af7e54a761891e7712.png"]}
