{"id":"twitter:1876682566939619714","tweet_id":"1876682566939619714","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876682566939619714","title":"@terrycowgill The Hearst Digital Media campaigns are also really hard to compete with for local papers My University tried a Hearst Campaign and we ge","summary":"@terrycowgill The Hearst Digital Media campaigns are also really hard to compete with for local papers My University tried a Hearst Campaign and we geofenced ballparks during baseball seasons in particular towns The referral and impression rates were crazy high","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T17:29:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876682223115702741","reply_tweet_id":"1876682223115702741","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@terrycowgill The Hearst Digital Media campaigns are also really hard to compete with for local papers<br><br>My University tried a Hearst Campaign and we geofenced ballparks during baseball seasons in particular towns<br><br>The referral and impression rates were crazy high</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876682566939619714","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 17:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1876682223115702741","tweet_id":"1876682223115702741","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876682223115702741","title":"@terrycowgill And that is why I am trying to think of what can be the value add to local news. If you can give merchants the ability to sell coupons f","summary":"@terrycowgill And that is why I am trying to think of what can be the value add to local news. If you can give merchants the ability to sell coupons for an MRR subscription, and then attractreaders with \"shop local\" deals Make adverts something companies subscribe to and not buy","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T17:28:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/terrycowgill/status/1876680919853248608","reply_tweet_id":"1876680919853248608","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@terrycowgill And that is why I am trying to think of what can be the value add to local news.<br><br>If you can give merchants the ability to sell coupons for an MRR subscription, and then attractreaders with &quot;shop local&quot; deals<br><br>Make adverts something companies subscribe to and not buy</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876682223115702741","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 17:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1876681512952975602","tweet_id":"1876681512952975602","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876681512952975602","title":"@davetroy 100% We see folks already telling everyone to show deference to the office and Institutions It protects those in power. Bureaucracy is slow,","summary":"@davetroy 100% We see folks already telling everyone to show deference to the office and Institutions It protects those in power. Bureaucracy is slow, and that can be a feature not a bug, I am waiting to see how much of the Qanon Cabinet makes it through I don't see Thune saying no","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T17:25:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/davetroy/status/1876676592237412825","reply_tweet_id":"1876676592237412825","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@davetroy 100% We see folks already telling everyone to show deference to the office and Institutions<br><br>It protects those in power.<br><br>Bureaucracy is slow, and that can be a feature not a bug, I am waiting to see how much of the Qanon Cabinet makes it through<br><br>I don&#x27;t see Thune saying no</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876681512952975602","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 17:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
