{"id":"twitter:1876679694852280753","tweet_id":"1876679694852280753","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876679694852280753","title":"@terrycowgill It is of deep interest to me. It's hard to think about ways to clawback the revenue from Classifieds AND Real Estate I won't pretend to ","summary":"@terrycowgill It is of deep interest to me. It's hard to think about ways to clawback the revenue from Classifieds AND Real Estate I won't pretend to know the answer, but it seems a massive threat losing all local papers, a trend taht ebbs and flows, but gushes now","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T17:18:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/terrycowgill/status/1876677333278687487","reply_tweet_id":"1876677333278687487","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@terrycowgill It is of deep interest to me. It&#x27;s hard to think about ways to clawback the revenue from Classifieds AND Real Estate<br><br>I won&#x27;t pretend to know the answer, but it seems a massive threat losing all local papers, a trend taht ebbs and flows, but gushes now</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876679694852280753","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 17:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
