{"id":"twitter:1876644755398119786","tweet_id":"1876644755398119786","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876644755398119786","title":"@z3dster No, but I am sure it happens And this is why I tell companies who may not have FOIA concerns to also descope AI transcription Minutes > Trans","summary":"@z3dster No, but I am sure it happens And this is why I tell companies who may not have FOIA concerns to also descope AI transcription Minutes > Transcripts when subpoenaed too.","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T14:59:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/z3dster/status/1876644305407991888","reply_tweet_id":"1876644305407991888","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@z3dster No, but I am sure it happens<br><br>And this is why I tell companies who may not have FOIA concerns to also descope AI transcription<br><br>Minutes &gt; Transcripts when subpoenaed too.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876644755398119786","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 14:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1876643997642584486","tweet_id":"1876643997642584486","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876643997642584486","title":"Recorded meetings do make transcripts available, and regardless of AI, still find a near 7:1 time ratio in cleaning them up. Many companies and firms ","summary":"Recorded meetings do make transcripts available, and regardless of AI, still find a near 7:1 time ratio in cleaning them up. Many companies and firms may not check automated transcripts. You should. Funny things can happen Have procedures in place to review any public assets","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T14:56:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876643190415167725","reply_tweet_id":"1876643190415167725","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Recorded meetings do make transcripts available, and regardless of AI, still find a near 7:1 time ratio in cleaning them up.<br><br>Many companies and firms may not check automated transcripts. You should. Funny things can happen<br><br>Have procedures in place to review any public assets</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876643997642584486","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 14:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1876643190415167725","tweet_id":"1876643190415167725","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876643190415167725","title":"We do not use automated AI transcription during our meetings for a few reasons: 1: Meetings are FOIAble 2: Copilot y doesn't recognize sensitivity lab","summary":"We do not use automated AI transcription during our meetings for a few reasons: 1: Meetings are FOIAble 2: Copilot y doesn't recognize sensitivity labels in Teams meetings and chats. 3: Minutes > Transcripts. Give people space to be human and not afraid of being recorded.","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T14:52:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>We do not use automated AI transcription during our meetings for a few  reasons:<br><br>1: Meetings are FOIAble<br>2: Copilot y doesn&#x27;t recognize sensitivity labels in Teams meetings and chats.<br>3: Minutes &gt; Transcripts. Give people space to be human and not afraid of being recorded.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876643190415167725","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 14:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
