{"id":"twitter:1876471226270421421","tweet_id":"1876471226270421421","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876471226270421421","title":"@ImposeCost It's like all the Libertarian heroes turn out to be simps. And the Fash-Left is ten times worse like Blumenthal and The Grayzone. . Regard","summary":"@ImposeCost It's like all the Libertarian heroes turn out to be simps. And the Fash-Left is ten times worse like Blumenthal and The Grayzone. . Regardless of story told, fear the well researched with a myopic view the most. For those two realities can't co-exist. https://t.co/4IzjOFVRTf","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T03:29:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ImposeCost/status/1876468695624749420","reply_tweet_id":"1876468695624749420","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ImposeCost It&#x27;s like all the Libertarian heroes turn out to be simps.<br><br>And the Fash-Left is ten times worse like Blumenthal and The Grayzone. .<br><br>Regardless of story told, fear the well researched with a myopic view the most. For those two realities can&#x27;t co-exist. <a href=\"https://t.co/4IzjOFVRTf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/4IzjOFVRTf</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/489d8a7e009aa3dc5ca674ae214e92f5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/37f32c84dc7b5cafe5284425d1626745.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876471226270421421","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 03:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/489d8a7e009aa3dc5ca674ae214e92f5.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/37f32c84dc7b5cafe5284425d1626745.jpg"]}
