{"id":"twitter:1876462443645243725","tweet_id":"1876462443645243725","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1876462443645243725","title":"@xtw1tt No, it is not, but no US President, who is Commander in Chief will ever stand trial at The Hague. American Service-Members' Protection Act cov","summary":"@xtw1tt No, it is not, but no US President, who is Commander in Chief will ever stand trial at The Hague. American Service-Members' Protection Act covers military and US Officials. We literally would be required by law to invade Netherlands. And don't confuse me for a Trump supporter","date":"2025-01-07","published":"2025-01-07T02:54:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1876461370843271205","reply_tweet_id":"1876461370843271205","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@xtw1tt No, it is not, but no US President, who is Commander in Chief will ever stand trial at The Hague.<br><br>American Service-Members&#x27; Protection Act covers military and US Officials.<br><br>We literally would be required by law to invade Netherlands.<br><br>And don&#x27;t confuse me for a Trump supporter</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1876462443645243725","display_date":"January 07, 2025 · 02:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
