{"id":"twitter:1875682451504484362","tweet_id":"1875682451504484362","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875682451504484362","title":"@dianesbaker1 You still need a toolbox to track your compliance for a third party to check and issue a certificate. You can ask, \"Is a GRC tool better","summary":"@dianesbaker1 You still need a toolbox to track your compliance for a third party to check and issue a certificate. You can ask, \"Is a GRC tool better than my spreadsheet\" But no matter what you have to document how you meet your security requirements.","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T23:15:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1875680845606089047","reply_tweet_id":"1875680845606089047","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 You still need a toolbox to track your compliance for a third party to check and issue a certificate.<br><br>You can ask, &quot;Is a GRC tool better than my spreadsheet&quot;<br><br>But no matter what you have to document how you meet your security requirements.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875682451504484362","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 23:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1875680121253982305","tweet_id":"1875680121253982305","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875680121253982305","title":"@dianesbaker1 That's what GRC is, you are tell your security story for compliance Third party verification is coming. Even though most contractors sti","summary":"@dianesbaker1 That's what GRC is, you are tell your security story for compliance Third party verification is coming. Even though most contractors still self-assess, the majority will choose a third party to verify that self-asessment","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T23:06:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1875679321035305118","reply_tweet_id":"1875679321035305118","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 That&#x27;s what GRC is, you are tell your security story for compliance<br><br>Third party verification is coming.<br><br>Even though most contractors still self-assess, the majority will choose a third party to verify that self-asessment</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875680121253982305","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 23:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1875678682377027967","tweet_id":"1875678682377027967","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875678682377027967","title":"@dianesbaker1 It s a docker scripts with a bunch of YAML files for different standards and frameworks The UI just tries to group different People, pro","summary":"@dianesbaker1 It s a docker scripts with a bunch of YAML files for different standards and frameworks The UI just tries to group different People, processes, and technologies together by use rather than Domain family. And no third party tool determines access, you do that","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T23:00:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1875677192539279421","reply_tweet_id":"1875677192539279421","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 It s a docker scripts with a bunch of YAML files for different standards and frameworks<br><br>The UI just tries to group different People, processes, and technologies together by use rather than Domain family.<br><br>And no third party tool determines access, you do that</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875678682377027967","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 23:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
