{"id":"twitter:1875361751291850799","tweet_id":"1875361751291850799","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875361751291850799","title":"@jayson_cornish @adhdwonderwoman Super fast run down. The debate is does money = speech? Fairness Doctrine 1987. Tom Ellis and Jesse Helms Willie Hort","summary":"@jayson_cornish @adhdwonderwoman Super fast run down. The debate is does money = speech? Fairness Doctrine 1987. Tom Ellis and Jesse Helms Willie Horton ad against Dan Quayle. That involved Citizens United. Citizens United was Floyd Brown and David Bossie. Citizens United VS FEC, opened gates Bossie-> Trump","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T02:00:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jayson_cornish/status/1875360326121877935","reply_tweet_id":"1875360326121877935","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jayson_cornish @adhdwonderwoman Super fast run down. The debate is does money = speech? <br><br>Fairness Doctrine 1987. Tom Ellis and Jesse Helms<br>Willie Horton ad against Dan Quayle. That involved Citizens United.<br>Citizens United was Floyd Brown and David Bossie.<br>Citizens United VS FEC, opened gates<br>Bossie-&gt; Trump</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875361751291850799","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 02:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
