{"id":"twitter:1875354398089736232","tweet_id":"1875354398089736232","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875354398089736232","title":"@LongCovidSP @JohnnyRickman14 Umm.... Trump has kinda nominated the crossover of the Qanon and Great Barrington Declaration Cabinet. That's why RFK Jr","summary":"@LongCovidSP @JohnnyRickman14 Umm.... Trump has kinda nominated the crossover of the Qanon and Great Barrington Declaration Cabinet. That's why RFK Jr is important to Trump. Holds the Brainworm crown coalition together.","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T01:31:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LongCovidSP/status/1875351723822416014","reply_tweet_id":"1875351723822416014","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LongCovidSP @JohnnyRickman14 Umm.... Trump has kinda nominated the crossover of the Qanon and Great Barrington Declaration Cabinet.<br><br>That&#x27;s why RFK Jr is important to Trump. Holds the Brainworm crown coalition together.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875354398089736232","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 01:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1875353464794169603","tweet_id":"1875353464794169603","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875353464794169603","title":"@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 So disenfranchised GOP, and dumb ass #FreePalpatine voters didn't vote in the top of ticket or wrote in just enough (2.5%ish, I th","summary":"@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 So disenfranchised GOP, and dumb ass #FreePalpatine voters didn't vote in the top of ticket or wrote in just enough (2.5%ish, I think, don't quote). And the Chudnik vote and young first time male voters (across demo) only voted top. only talking 200,000 vote = Harris win","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T01:28:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875352380973445588","reply_tweet_id":"1875352380973445588","tags":["FreePalpatine"],"body_html":"<p>@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 So disenfranchised GOP, and dumb ass #FreePalpatine voters didn&#x27;t vote in the top of ticket or wrote in just enough (2.5%ish, I think, don&#x27;t quote).<br><br>And the Chudnik vote and young first time  male voters (across demo) only voted top.<br><br>only talking 200,000 vote = Harris win</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875353464794169603","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 01:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1875352380973445588","tweet_id":"1875352380973445588","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875352380973445588","title":"@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 He didn't even win a majority of votes, it was more, a plurality, but a majority of voters did not support Donald Trump. I see it ","summary":"@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 He didn't even win a majority of votes, it was more, a plurality, but a majority of voters did not support Donald Trump. I see it more as an unpopular vote. Just a guess but I think high propensity voters skipped top up tix, low propensity only voted top of tix. Thus split.","date":"2025-01-04","published":"2025-01-04T01:23:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/KRL797/status/1875350677603676494","reply_tweet_id":"1875350677603676494","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@KRL797 @UROCKlive1 He didn&#x27;t even win a majority of votes, it was more, a plurality, but a majority of voters did not support Donald Trump.<br><br>I see it more as an unpopular vote. Just a guess but I think high propensity voters skipped top up tix, low propensity only voted top of tix.<br><br>Thus split.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875352380973445588","display_date":"January 04, 2025 · 01:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
