{"id":"twitter:1875252680878387238","tweet_id":"1875252680878387238","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875252680878387238","title":"@TheSlotinCore @SpaghettiKozak @smcroasters Using language of \"Brother\" between Ukrainian and russians during a russian invasion of Ukraine is very bi","summary":"@TheSlotinCore @SpaghettiKozak @smcroasters Using language of \"Brother\" between Ukrainian and russians during a russian invasion of Ukraine is very biased. Maybe OGP wasn't familiar with the history of \"brother or other.\" But it's russian for vassal or enemy. Being anti-war means fighting back when you are invaded","date":"2025-01-03","published":"2025-01-03T18:47:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheSlotinCore/status/1875251229439500345","reply_tweet_id":"1875251229439500345","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheSlotinCore @SpaghettiKozak @smcroasters Using  language of &quot;Brother&quot; between Ukrainian and russians during a russian invasion of Ukraine is very biased.<br><br>Maybe OGP wasn&#x27;t familiar with the history of &quot;brother or other.&quot; <br><br>But it&#x27;s russian for vassal or enemy.<br><br>Being anti-war means fighting back when you are invaded</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875252680878387238","display_date":"January 03, 2025 · 18:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
