{"id":"twitter:1875173560236605690","tweet_id":"1875173560236605690","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1875173560236605690","title":"@AlliGee13 I have gone through the data of every spectacular suicide involving mass casualty events. You can even keep 9/11 casualties in and the patt","summary":"@AlliGee13 I have gone through the data of every spectacular suicide involving mass casualty events. You can even keep 9/11 casualties in and the pattern holds. Though I think mathematically you should remove Oklahoma City and 9/11 as outliers, and a risk to skew data.","date":"2025-01-03","published":"2025-01-03T13:33:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SleuthyFella/status/1875172690883211350","reply_tweet_id":"1875172690883211350","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AlliGee13 I have gone through the data of every spectacular suicide involving mass casualty events.<br><br>You can even keep 9/11 casualties in and the pattern holds.<br><br>Though I think mathematically you should remove Oklahoma City and 9/11 as outliers, and a risk to skew data.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1875173560236605690","display_date":"January 03, 2025 · 13:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
