{"id":"twitter:1874787266306179572","tweet_id":"1874787266306179572","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874787266306179572","title":"@BlueskyLibs The Special Counsel law requires a final report. It is up to Merrick Garland to decide if it gets released to the public. The report prob","summary":"@BlueskyLibs The Special Counsel law requires a final report. It is up to Merrick Garland to decide if it gets released to the public. The report probably needs a review of Classified data. If that takes more than the next 19 days we will never see the report. And it will get buried","date":"2025-01-02","published":"2025-01-02T11:58:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/BlueskyLibs/status/1873950413055254626","reply_tweet_id":"1873950413055254626","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BlueskyLibs The Special Counsel law requires a final report.<br><br>It is up to Merrick Garland to decide if it gets released to the public.<br><br>The report probably needs a review of Classified data. If that takes more than the next 19 days we will never see the report.<br><br>And it will get buried</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874787266306179572","display_date":"January 02, 2025 · 11:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
