{"id":"twitter:1874465617308524608","tweet_id":"1874465617308524608","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874465617308524608","title":"How does it work? There is a \"keyword\" for each day of the month. You then describe what you want the poem to be about. A volunteer then combines your","summary":"How does it work? There is a \"keyword\" for each day of the month. You then describe what you want the poem to be about. A volunteer then combines your idea with the key word. https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1874459709052428390","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T14:40:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>How does it work?<br><br>There is a &quot;keyword&quot; for each day of the month.<br><br>You then describe what you want the poem to be about.<br><br>A volunteer then combines your idea with the key word. <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1874459709052428390\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1874459709052428390</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874465617308524608","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 14:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
