{"id":"twitter:1874460884078371318","tweet_id":"1874460884078371318","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874460884078371318","title":"Not only is it wrong for a Defense Contractor CEO of @SpaceX to interject in International Politics. But the @SpaceX CEO reveals he is a moron who doe","summary":"Not only is it wrong for a Defense Contractor CEO of @SpaceX to interject in International Politics. But the @SpaceX CEO reveals he is a moron who doesn't understand German politics. The President is a ceremonial role. https://t.co/Tz1tLTVrS4","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T14:21:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Not only is it wrong for a Defense Contractor CEO of @SpaceX to interject in International Politics.<br><br>But the @SpaceX CEO reveals he is a moron who doesn&#x27;t understand German politics.<br><br>The President is a ceremonial role. <a href=\"https://t.co/Tz1tLTVrS4\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Tz1tLTVrS4</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/07ae489dccdc27ea6b518dae72470a6c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874460884078371318","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 14:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/07ae489dccdc27ea6b518dae72470a6c.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1874460304052248875","tweet_id":"1874460304052248875","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874460304052248875","title":"@Danni79021355 @proudwarrior27 @JohnnyRickman14 The Southern Florida Attorney General office can not prosecute a case without Attorney General approva","summary":"@Danni79021355 @proudwarrior27 @JohnnyRickman14 The Southern Florida Attorney General office can not prosecute a case without Attorney General approval. If they tried Trump has unilateral power to fire anyone in the Justice Department without cause. Plus he can just pardon the defendants. They got away with the crime.","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T14:18:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Danni79021355/status/1874459359427834043","reply_tweet_id":"1874459359427834043","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Danni79021355 @proudwarrior27 @JohnnyRickman14 The Southern Florida Attorney General office can not prosecute a case without Attorney General approval.<br><br>If they tried Trump has unilateral power to fire anyone in the Justice Department without cause.<br><br>Plus he can just pardon the defendants.<br><br>They got away with the crime.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874460304052248875","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 14:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
