{"id":"twitter:1874458724984852549","tweet_id":"1874458724984852549","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874458724984852549","title":"@proudwarrior27 @Danni79021355 @JohnnyRickman14 He handed it over to U.S. Attorney's Office for the Southern District of Florida not the Florida AG. I","summary":"@proudwarrior27 @Danni79021355 @JohnnyRickman14 He handed it over to U.S. Attorney's Office for the Southern District of Florida not the Florida AG. I doubt they can do much in 20 days. Trump, Bondi, and Patel will quash the investigation.","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T14:12:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/proudwarrior27/status/1874458013907742782","reply_tweet_id":"1874458013907742782","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@proudwarrior27 @Danni79021355 @JohnnyRickman14 He handed it over to U.S. Attorney&#x27;s Office for the Southern District of Florida not the Florida AG.<br><br>I doubt they can do much in 20 days.<br><br>Trump, Bondi, and Patel will quash the investigation.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874458724984852549","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 14:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
