{"id":"twitter:1874302064614166936","tweet_id":"1874302064614166936","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874302064614166936","title":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir I mean states like North Carolina and Arizona where Dems one many state races but Trump carried. I am guessing that dis","summary":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir I mean states like North Carolina and Arizona where Dems one many state races but Trump carried. I am guessing that disenfranchised GOP voters or #FreePalpatine Dems skipped top of ticket. We know Trump has voters who only voted top of ticket But I am kinda guessing.","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T03:50:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Dimking623463/status/1874300830100365319","reply_tweet_id":"1874300830100365319","tags":["FreePalpatine"],"body_html":"<p>@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir I mean states like North Carolina and Arizona where Dems one many state races but Trump carried.<br><br>I am guessing that disenfranchised GOP voters or #FreePalpatine Dems skipped top of ticket.<br><br>We know Trump has voters who only voted top of ticket<br><br>But I am kinda guessing.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874302064614166936","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 03:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
