{"id":"twitter:1874299327096713401","tweet_id":"1874299327096713401","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874299327096713401","title":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir And immigration lies and real concerns in Border states. You see split ticket voting because high propensity voters (GO","summary":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir And immigration lies and real concerns in Border states. You see split ticket voting because high propensity voters (GOP) skipped top of ticket Low propensity voters (young chuds) only voted top of ticket","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T03:39:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874298893657399721","reply_tweet_id":"1874298893657399721","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir And immigration lies and real concerns in Border states.<br><br>You see split ticket voting because high propensity voters (GOP) skipped top of ticket<br><br>Low propensity voters (young chuds) only voted top of ticket</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874299327096713401","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 03:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874298893657399721","tweet_id":"1874298893657399721","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874298893657399721","title":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir The reason I don't buy tabulation hacks is simple. If a precinct or county new they sent X votes, but then Y votes show","summary":"@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir The reason I don't buy tabulation hacks is simple. If a precinct or county new they sent X votes, but then Y votes show up in tabulation. You would catch the error immediately. Trump won in Arizona because \"Boys in Girls Sports\" played well with men.","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T03:37:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Dimking623463/status/1874298267338760656","reply_tweet_id":"1874298267338760656","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Dimking623463 @truhollywdnoir The reason I don&#x27;t buy tabulation hacks is simple.<br><br>If a precinct or county new they sent X votes, but then Y votes show up in tabulation.<br><br> You would catch the error immediately.<br><br>Trump won in Arizona because &quot;Boys in Girls Sports&quot; played well with men.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874298893657399721","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 03:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
