{"id":"twitter:1874295942805151954","tweet_id":"1874295942805151954","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874295942805151954","title":"@RepMikeLawler It's hard to take a case to trial when testimony is based on torture and extraordinary rendition. Not to mention protecting asset ident","summary":"@RepMikeLawler It's hard to take a case to trial when testimony is based on torture and extraordinary rendition. Not to mention protecting asset identity. Taking death penalty off table in plea deal stops the possibility of cases being tossed out of court.","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T03:25:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RepMikeLawler/status/1874187574698533312","reply_tweet_id":"1874187574698533312","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RepMikeLawler It&#x27;s hard to take a case to trial when testimony is based on torture and extraordinary rendition.<br><br>Not to mention protecting asset identity. <br><br>Taking death penalty off table in plea deal stops the possibility of cases being tossed out of court.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874295942805151954","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 03:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
