{"id":"twitter:1874279570691780889","tweet_id":"1874279570691780889","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874279570691780889","title":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Pl","summary":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept People replied to me. The Rome Accords and being a signatory are very re","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T02:20:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LittleSully1/status/1874277813299405148","reply_tweet_id":"1874277813299405148","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept People replied to me.<br><br>The Rome Accords and being a signatory are very relevant to how the ICC and The Hague works.<br><br>Even if they charged Trump, I doubt a Nation would arrest Trump on a State visit</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874279570691780889","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 02:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874279100384501867","tweet_id":"1874279100384501867","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874279100384501867","title":"@FellaAirlines @RealRiddimHours I live in Connecticut, two hours to Boston or the City and it takes 20 min to get to grocery store. House backs up to ","summary":"@FellaAirlines @RealRiddimHours I live in Connecticut, two hours to Boston or the City and it takes 20 min to get to grocery store. House backs up to thousands of acres of Open Space Granted houses are 10x in price to OGP... But I don't think people realize how big America is https://t.co/lJ1BCbdsvK","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T02:18:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/thatmedfella/status/1874274957703995601","reply_tweet_id":"1874274957703995601","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FellaAirlines @RealRiddimHours I live in Connecticut, two hours to Boston or the City and it takes 20 min to get to  grocery store.<br><br>House backs up to thousands of acres of Open Space <br><br>Granted houses are 10x in price to OGP... But I don&#x27;t think people realize how big America is <a href=\"https://t.co/lJ1BCbdsvK\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/lJ1BCbdsvK</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6a8058f8b00e97e5184c69711850f406.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874279100384501867","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 02:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6a8058f8b00e97e5184c69711850f406.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1874277313124409436","tweet_id":"1874277313124409436","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874277313124409436","title":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Pl","summary":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept And when Canada does charge folks like Mike Roman, as they should, do yo","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T02:11:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874276569319170285","reply_tweet_id":"1874276569319170285","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept And when Canada does charge folks like Mike Roman, as they should, do you think Trump, Bondi, or Blanche would allow Roman to be extradited?<br><br>Canada will have to wait.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874277313124409436","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 02:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874276569319170285","tweet_id":"1874276569319170285","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874276569319170285","title":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Pl","summary":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept The United States of America is not a signatory of the Rome Accords. Yes","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T02:08:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LittleSully1/status/1874275590892835036","reply_tweet_id":"1874275590892835036","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept The United States of America is not a signatory of the Rome Accords.<br><br>Yes the ICC can charge non-signatories. <br><br>Who in the Trump Administration is going to send Donald Trump to The Hague?<br><br>What country would arrest POTUS on a State visit?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874276569319170285","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 02:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
