{"id":"twitter:1874274525724238052","tweet_id":"1874274525724238052","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874274525724238052","title":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Pl","summary":"@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept I am not going to hide, I think the next fight is keeping as few crimina","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T02:00:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LittleSully1/status/1874273115599188247","reply_tweet_id":"1874273115599188247","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LittleSully1 @Danni79021355 @MaxxMilly808 @wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept I am not going to hide, I think the next fight is keeping as few criminals out of the Cabinet as possible.<br><br>But hoping for some magical pixie dust International Criminal Court solution is silly.<br><br>I&#x27;ll let you folks keep hoping and leave the thread.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874274525724238052","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 02:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874273951670821321","tweet_id":"1874273951670821321","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874273951670821321","title":"In the end average Americans are scoreboard voter, don't care about playbook. And like winners. Department of Justice lost, and Trump won on every fro","summary":"In the end average Americans are scoreboard voter, don't care about playbook. And like winners. Department of Justice lost, and Trump won on every front. He planned a coup, didn't stop the J6th putsch, and got away with the most obvious theft of National Defense Secrets https://t.co/nZjhfY1Z74","date":"2025-01-01","published":"2025-01-01T01:58:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874271980532429268","reply_tweet_id":"1874271980532429268","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In the end average Americans are scoreboard voter,  don&#x27;t care about playbook.<br><br>And  like winners.<br><br> Department of Justice lost, and Trump won on every front.<br><br>He planned a coup, didn&#x27;t stop the J6th putsch, and got away with the most obvious theft of National Defense Secrets <a href=\"https://t.co/nZjhfY1Z74\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nZjhfY1Z74</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/85869ecc2e2b954a5b8eb097891e6e1e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9806261a839edc0c748e3e1aee4eab16.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/345cf386ae19c19e2bbba2b136665a3f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874273951670821321","display_date":"January 01, 2025 · 01:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/85869ecc2e2b954a5b8eb097891e6e1e.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/9806261a839edc0c748e3e1aee4eab16.jpg","/