{"id":"twitter:1874203416236576949","tweet_id":"1874203416236576949","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874203416236576949","title":"@21vams21 Who is? Nothing annoys me more than the fact that: -DOJ never atrrested a single QANON organizer -Senate never held a single QANON hearing -","summary":"@21vams21 Who is? Nothing annoys me more than the fact that: -DOJ never atrrested a single QANON organizer -Senate never held a single QANON hearing -House never had a QANON Select Committee It boggles my brain, really, we just pretend it never happened","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T21:18:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/21vams21/status/1874202968440078555","reply_tweet_id":"1874202968440078555","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@21vams21 Who is?<br><br>Nothing annoys me more than the fact that:<br><br>-DOJ never atrrested a single QANON organizer<br>-Senate never held a single QANON hearing<br>-House never had a QANON Select Committee<br><br>It boggles my brain, really, we just pretend it never happened</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874203416236576949","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 21:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874202902702546997","tweet_id":"1874202902702546997","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874202902702546997","title":"“How can we talk about a children’s drawing contest for Children’s Day, or organizing dance recitals for Victory Day when there are children dying eve","summary":"“How can we talk about a children’s drawing contest for Children’s Day, or organizing dance recitals for Victory Day when there are children dying every day?” On April 26 2022, Gorinov was arrested, tried, and sentenced for seven years ...for not holding a drawing contest","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T21:16:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874202428096340158","reply_tweet_id":"1874202428096340158","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>“How can we talk about a children’s drawing contest for Children’s Day,  or organizing dance recitals for Victory Day when there are children  dying every day?”<br><br>On April 26  2022, Gorinov was arrested, tried, and sentenced for seven years<br><br>...for not holding a drawing contest</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874202902702546997","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 21:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874202428096340158","tweet_id":"1874202428096340158","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874202428096340158","title":"Alexei Gorinov was sentenced to seven years in prison for speaking out against russia's invasion of Ukraine A member of the pro-democracy Solidarnost ","summary":"Alexei Gorinov was sentenced to seven years in prison for speaking out against russia's invasion of Ukraine A member of the pro-democracy Solidarnost movement, he was deputy of Moscow's Krasnoselsky District Council. He didn't want to hold a Dance and drawing contest for kids https://t.co/PJtXfOputK","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T21:14:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874192402380095557","reply_tweet_id":"1874192402380095557","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Alexei Gorinov was sentenced to seven years in prison for speaking out against russia&#x27;s invasion of Ukraine<br><br>A member of the pro-democracy Solidarnost movement,  he was deputy of Moscow&#x27;s Krasnoselsky District Council.<br><br>He didn&#x27;t want to hold a Dance and drawing contest for kids <a href=\"https://t.co/PJtXfOputK\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/PJtXfOputK</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e8d13eeb593f38b77adc6b1ad5cd29d0.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874202428096340158","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 21:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e8d13eeb593f38b77adc6b1ad5cd29d0.jpg"]}
