{"id":"twitter:1874190847715270886","tweet_id":"1874190847715270886","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874190847715270886","title":"@AdrianeZane It just extended the National Emergency by a year I believe, yes? Again my apologies for mixing up the Executive Orders.","summary":"@AdrianeZane It just extended the National Emergency by a year I believe, yes? Again my apologies for mixing up the Executive Orders.","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T20:28:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AdrianeZane/status/1874189900922445906","reply_tweet_id":"1874189900922445906","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AdrianeZane It just extended the National Emergency by a year I believe, yes?<br><br>Again my apologies for mixing up the Executive Orders.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874190847715270886","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 20:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874189956236886257","tweet_id":"1874189956236886257","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874189956236886257","title":"@AdrianeZane @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW I disagree with folks who think an Executive Order is enough to stop Trump's inauguration. I also highly dou","summary":"@AdrianeZane @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW I disagree with folks who think an Executive Order is enough to stop Trump's inauguration. I also highly doubt the US Government would ever extradite Trump to The Hague or even honor an Interpol Red Notice. Especially after January 20th when Trump is in White House","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T20:24:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AdrianeZane/status/1874189251564494933","reply_tweet_id":"1874189251564494933","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AdrianeZane @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW I disagree with folks who think an Executive Order is enough to stop Trump&#x27;s inauguration.<br><br>I also highly doubt the US Government would ever extradite Trump to The Hague or even honor an Interpol Red Notice.<br><br>Especially after January 20th when Trump is in White House</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874189956236886257","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 20:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874189415054270572","tweet_id":"1874189415054270572","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874189415054270572","title":"@AdrianeZane True... But I was wrong at the same time. I had my Executive Orders mixed up. I just think it is silly some Influencers are pushing idea ","summary":"@AdrianeZane True... But I was wrong at the same time. I had my Executive Orders mixed up. I just think it is silly some Influencers are pushing idea an Executive Order will stop Trump's inauguration. It won't.","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T20:22:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AdrianeZane/status/1874188456727081001","reply_tweet_id":"1874188456727081001","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AdrianeZane True... But I was wrong at the same time.<br><br>I had my Executive Orders mixed up. <br><br>I just think it is silly some Influencers are pushing idea an Executive Order will stop Trump&#x27;s inauguration.<br><br>It won&#x27;t.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874189415054270572","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 20:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874189018113728551","tweet_id":"1874189018113728551","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874189018113728551","title":"Authority for EO 13848 flows from International Emergency Economic Powers Act, , the National Emergencies Act, and the Immigration and Nationality Act","summary":"Authority for EO 13848 flows from International Emergency Economic Powers Act, , the National Emergencies Act, and the Immigration and Nationality Act. So used to russian sanctions from OFAC tied to Magnitsky Act, not EO 13848. Apologies for the mistake","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T20:20:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874187615756587407","reply_tweet_id":"1874187615756587407","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Authority for EO 13848 flows from International Emergency Economic Powers Act, , the National Emergencies Act, and the Immigration and Nationality Act.<br><br>So used to russian sanctions from OFAC tied to Magnitsky Act, not EO 13848.<br><br>Apologies for the mistake</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874189018113728551","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 20:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1874188456827773019","tweet_id":"1874188456827773019","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874188456827773019","title":"@wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @Danni79021355 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @onestpress @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs","summary":"@wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @Danni79021355 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @onestpress @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @MaxxMilly808 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept And I was wrong, authority flows International Emergency Economic Powers A","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T20:18:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/wends1958/status/1874187403659010359","reply_tweet_id":"1874187403659010359","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@wends1958 @thinkerbelle013 @Danni79021355 @RNBSNMPH @KellyKarmaQueen @TitleChase @jzikah @vbbernard @onestpress @BaddCompani @Lets_Play_MEOW @baddogs4343 @karolcummins @JamesFLoveIV @SassiestMinx @Raven_Call @RNDog12 @MaxxMilly808 @TheDemocrats @JoeBiden @KamalaHarris @TheJusticeDept And I was wrong, authority flows International Emergency Economic Powers Act (IEEPA), the National Emergencies Act and the  Immigration and Nationality Act of 1952 (8 U.S.C. 1182<br><br>Not Magnitsky.<br><br>Interesting OFAC used EO 13848 to sanction Dugin&#x27;s crew.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874188456827773019","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 20:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
