{"id":"twitter:1874163487972483139","tweet_id":"1874163487972483139","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1874163487972483139","title":"@TreacherousArr @RepDonBacon Simon Shuster is a garbage Vatnik journalist but I still dig Representative Bacon's voice on Ukraine and he is one of the","summary":"@TreacherousArr @RepDonBacon Simon Shuster is a garbage Vatnik journalist but I still dig Representative Bacon's voice on Ukraine and he is one of the few cyber folk left in Congress. Yes he supported GOP Nominee in the election but he was far from a MAGA voice in Congress. Just not a fan of a litmus test","date":"2024-12-31","published":"2024-12-31T18:39:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TreacherousArr/status/1874161357362430357","reply_tweet_id":"1874161357362430357","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TreacherousArr @RepDonBacon Simon Shuster is a garbage Vatnik journalist but I still dig Representative Bacon&#x27;s voice on Ukraine and he is one of the few cyber folk left in Congress.<br><br>Yes he supported GOP Nominee in the election but he was far from a MAGA voice in Congress.<br><br>Just not a fan of a litmus test</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1874163487972483139","display_date":"December 31, 2024 · 18:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
