{"id":"twitter:1873843007520465187","tweet_id":"1873843007520465187","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1873843007520465187","title":"@Timodc He won an unpopular vote. High propensity voters skipped top of the ticket, and low propensity voters only voted top of ticket This created th","summary":"@Timodc He won an unpopular vote. High propensity voters skipped top of the ticket, and low propensity voters only voted top of ticket This created the split ticket illusion (and these methods should have been expected from Team LaCivita)","date":"2024-12-30","published":"2024-12-30T21:26:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Timodc/status/1873842047825961104","reply_tweet_id":"1873842047825961104","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Timodc He won an unpopular vote.<br><br>High propensity voters skipped top of the ticket, and low propensity voters only voted top of ticket<br><br>This created the split ticket illusion<br><br>(and these methods should have been expected from Team LaCivita)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1873843007520465187","display_date":"December 30, 2024 · 21:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
