{"id":"twitter:2090357854662426975","tweet_id":"2090357854662426975","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2090357854662426975","title":"I just read the devastating news. My heart bleeds for @lotta_love43 @Justadutchguy was the best humanity had to offer. I will cherish the laughs we ha","summary":"I just read the devastating news. My heart bleeds for @lotta_love43 @Justadutchguy was the best humanity had to offer. I will cherish the laughs we had together in the early days mocking and meming GOPniks and vatniks. He worked tirelessly as a volunteer. https://t.co/eIHUtXF1nr","date":"2026-08-20","published":"2026-08-20T08:38:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I just read the devastating news. My heart bleeds for @lotta_love43<br><br>@Justadutchguy was the best humanity had to offer.<br><br>I will cherish the laughs we had together in the early days mocking and meming GOPniks and vatniks.<br><br>He worked tirelessly as a volunteer. <a href=\"https://t.co/eIHUtXF1nr\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/eIHUtXF1nr</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/35efeacc0896f5b8df071688a351ebb0.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2090357854662426975","display_date":"August 20, 2026 · 08:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/35efeacc0896f5b8df071688a351ebb0.jpg"]}
