{"id":"twitter:1873409765549707603","tweet_id":"1873409765549707603","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1873409765549707603","title":"There could be reasons this happened, like if said foreign governments had active investigations going, and asked they weren't interrupted. That's the","summary":"There could be reasons this happened, like if said foreign governments had active investigations going, and asked they weren't interrupted. That's the best I can come up with, and there are some QANON mentions in J6th trials and plea deals. But that's all boots, no suits","date":"2024-12-29","published":"2024-12-29T16:44:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1873382913066353092","reply_tweet_id":"1873382913066353092","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>There could be reasons this happened, like if said foreign governments had active investigations going, and asked they weren&#x27;t interrupted.<br><br>That&#x27;s the best I can come up with, and there are some QANON mentions in J6th trials and plea deals.<br><br>But that&#x27;s all boots, no suits</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1873409765549707603","display_date":"December 29, 2024 · 16:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
