{"id":"twitter:1872294964773994609","tweet_id":"1872294964773994609","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1872294964773994609","title":"@logyAussie @Chuck_H1987 Department of Health, Education, and Welfare (HEW) was the federal agency that issued guidelines to help Southern school dist","summary":"@logyAussie @Chuck_H1987 Department of Health, Education, and Welfare (HEW) was the federal agency that issued guidelines to help Southern school districts comply with the desegregation orders of the 1954 Brown v. Board of Education. DOEd established in 1977 to continue the work.","date":"2024-12-26","published":"2024-12-26T14:54:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/logyAussie/status/1872293134874587574","reply_tweet_id":"1872293134874587574","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@logyAussie @Chuck_H1987 Department of Health, Education, and Welfare (HEW) was the federal agency that issued guidelines to help Southern school districts comply with the desegregation orders of the 1954 Brown v. Board of Education.<br><br>DOEd established in 1977 to continue the work.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1872294964773994609","display_date":"December 26, 2024 · 14:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
