{"id":"twitter:1871561527972749765","tweet_id":"1871561527972749765","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1871561527972749765","title":"@EyesofRepublic It's a bit more than that, and it explains the division(ish) of labor with Influence Campaigns. Under US Law these efforts fall under ","summary":"@EyesofRepublic It's a bit more than that, and it explains the division(ish) of labor with Influence Campaigns. Under US Law these efforts fall under the purview of the State Department. The Global Engagement Center traces back to Executive Order 13584 of 2011 but got it's name in EO 13721","date":"2024-12-24","published":"2024-12-24T14:20:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1871391409951154564","reply_tweet_id":"1871391409951154564","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EyesofRepublic It&#x27;s a bit more than that, and it explains the division(ish) of labor with Influence Campaigns.<br><br>Under US Law these efforts fall under the purview of the State Department.<br><br>The Global Engagement Center traces back to Executive Order 13584 of 2011 but got it&#x27;s name in EO 13721</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1871561527972749765","display_date":"December 24, 2024 · 14:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
