{"id":"twitter:1870118115515785343","tweet_id":"1870118115515785343","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1870118115515785343","title":"@Kronykal @ChrisMurphyCT The troops do get paid, but 2.2 million civilian federal employees and 3.7 million federal contractors don't get paid. You do","summary":"@Kronykal @ChrisMurphyCT The troops do get paid, but 2.2 million civilian federal employees and 3.7 million federal contractors don't get paid. You don't think that affects mission readiness? Also a dick move to do before Christmas","date":"2024-12-20","published":"2024-12-20T14:44:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Kronykal/status/1870110438597275753","reply_tweet_id":"1870110438597275753","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Kronykal @ChrisMurphyCT The troops do get paid, but 2.2 million civilian federal employees and  3.7 million federal contractors don&#x27;t get paid.<br><br>You don&#x27;t think that affects mission readiness?<br><br>Also a dick move to do before Christmas</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1870118115515785343","display_date":"December 20, 2024 · 14:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
