{"id":"twitter:1869800841273803257","tweet_id":"1869800841273803257","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1869800841273803257","title":"Freelon, Bossetta, Wells, Lukito , Xia , and Adams work suggests \"The Black activist\" accounts in trolling datasets should be included as it is the be","summary":"Freelon, Bossetta, Wells, Lukito , Xia , and Adams work suggests \"The Black activist\" accounts in trolling datasets should be included as it is the best predictor in account engagement (at least for 2016 dataset) https://t.co/wmrs0XVBfI","date":"2024-12-19","published":"2024-12-19T17:43:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1869798580061647003","reply_tweet_id":"1869798580061647003","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Freelon, Bossetta,  Wells, Lukito , Xia , and Adams work suggests &quot;The Black activist&quot; accounts in trolling datasets should be included as it is the best predictor in account engagement<br><br>(at least for 2016 dataset) <a href=\"https://t.co/wmrs0XVBfI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/wmrs0XVBfI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a196aa020f8f3feb9f7b1684ebe06c68.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1869800841273803257","display_date":"December 19, 2024 · 17:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a196aa020f8f3feb9f7b1684ebe06c68.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1869798580061647003","tweet_id":"1869798580061647003","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1869798580061647003","title":"In examining the Twitter dataset from the Internet Research Agency (Piggy's trolls) Linvill and Warren identified seven troll types in American networ","summary":"In examining the Twitter dataset from the Internet Research Agency (Piggy's trolls) Linvill and Warren identified seven troll types in American networks. Frelon et al added Black trolls as an eight type. The taxonomy still works well to today and gets built into LLM models https://t.co/jQqnEQPK69","date":"2024-12-19","published":"2024-12-19T17:34:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In examining the Twitter dataset from the Internet Research Agency (Piggy&#x27;s trolls) Linvill and Warren identified seven troll types in American networks. <br><br>Frelon et al added Black trolls as an eight type.<br><br>The taxonomy still works well to today and gets built into LLM models <a href=\"https://t.co/jQqnEQPK69\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/jQqnEQPK69</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/450f065462b6483042ef3dc60e0d2d3b.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1869798580061647003","display_date":"December 19, 2024 · 17:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/450f065462b6483042ef3dc60e0d2d3b.png"]}
