{"id":"twitter:2047003484218663023","tweet_id":"2047003484218663023","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2047003484218663023","title":"@BuzzfeedEx @damintoell @bonchieredstate funding snitches to snitch isn't funding the rally It will be interesting if F-37 is Jason Kessler as I suspe","summary":"@BuzzfeedEx @damintoell @bonchieredstate funding snitches to snitch isn't funding the rally It will be interesting if F-37 is Jason Kessler as I suspect, but the indictment makes no mention of F-37 pulling the permits for the Unite the Right rally So maybe F-37 is someone else","date":"2026-04-22","published":"2026-04-22T17:23:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/BuzzfeedEx/status/2047002635048206743","reply_tweet_id":"2047002635048206743","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BuzzfeedEx @damintoell @bonchieredstate funding snitches to snitch isn&#x27;t funding the rally<br><br>It will be interesting if F-37 is Jason Kessler as I suspect, but the indictment makes no mention of F-37 pulling the permits for the Unite the Right rally<br><br>So maybe F-37 is someone else</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2047003484218663023","display_date":"April 22, 2026 · 17:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
