{"id":"twitter:1867647556949618893","tweet_id":"1867647556949618893","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1867647556949618893","title":"@kkyrio Secure by Design is always a great excuse to push deployment back. Especially for a vulnerability scanner. Build the DevSecOps procedures now,","summary":"@kkyrio Secure by Design is always a great excuse to push deployment back. Especially for a vulnerability scanner. Build the DevSecOps procedures now, before you scale. It's a bajillion times cheaper even if you don't push to production on time.","date":"2024-12-13","published":"2024-12-13T19:07:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/kkyrio/status/1867646524089676162","reply_tweet_id":"1867646524089676162","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@kkyrio Secure by Design is always a great excuse to push deployment back.<br><br>Especially for a vulnerability scanner.<br><br>Build the DevSecOps procedures now, before you scale.<br><br>It&#x27;s a bajillion times cheaper even if you don&#x27;t push to production on time.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1867647556949618893","display_date":"December 13, 2024 · 19:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
