{"id":"twitter:1867300841725575256","tweet_id":"1867300841725575256","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1867300841725575256","title":"@Heidi_Cuda This is a good read (you probably already have it) on the interagency working group on russian Active Measures https://upload.wikimedia.or","summary":"@Heidi_Cuda This is a good read (you probably already have it) on the interagency working group on russian Active Measures https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Deception,_Disinformation,_and_Strategic_Communications.pdf There was tension between State and Intel then too, oh also Robert Hansen sat on the meetings in later years It's not new","date":"2024-12-12","published":"2024-12-12T20:09:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1867300376359449072","reply_tweet_id":"1867300376359449072","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Heidi_Cuda This is a good read (you probably already have it) on the interagency working group on russian Active Measures<br><br><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Deception,_Disinformation,_and_Strategic_Communications.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Deception,_Disinformation,_and_Strategic_Communications.pdf</a><br><br>There was tension between State and Intel then too, oh also Robert Hansen sat on the meetings in later years<br><br>It&#x27;s not new</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1867300841725575256","display_date":"December 12, 2024 · 20:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1867300376359449072","tweet_id":"1867300376359449072","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1867300376359449072","title":"@Heidi_Cuda It's a long debate in Cyber, but I am weary of Military operations with American citizens as targets. What does it mean to have the milita","summary":"@Heidi_Cuda It's a long debate in Cyber, but I am weary of Military operations with American citizens as targets. What does it mean to have the military involved in interuppting influence campaigns run through political parties? It's usually State and DOJ's job.","date":"2024-12-12","published":"2024-12-12T20:07:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Heidi_Cuda/status/1867292488039641236","reply_tweet_id":"1867292488039641236","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Heidi_Cuda It&#x27;s a long debate in Cyber, but I am weary of Military operations with American citizens as targets.<br><br>What does it mean to have the military involved in interuppting influence campaigns run through political parties?<br><br>It&#x27;s usually State and DOJ&#x27;s job.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1867300376359449072","display_date":"December 12, 2024 · 20:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
