{"id":"twitter:1867221181440405940","tweet_id":"1867221181440405940","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1867221181440405940","title":"@EyeofhorusC Well we lost access to the API, but have some historical datasets We took 27,000 tweets mentioning \"ukronazi\" we then trained a model tha","summary":"@EyeofhorusC Well we lost access to the API, but have some historical datasets We took 27,000 tweets mentioning \"ukronazi\" we then trained a model that correlated homophily with different ad buys We could spot botnets instantly with hella good accuracy Here is a quick correlation chart https://t.co/EKdrFPAiqS","date":"2024-12-12","published":"2024-12-12T14:53:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1867219630298943544","reply_tweet_id":"1867219630298943544","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EyeofhorusC Well we lost access to the API, but have some historical datasets<br><br>We took 27,000 tweets mentioning &quot;ukronazi&quot; we then trained a model that correlated homophily with different ad buys<br><br>We could spot botnets instantly with hella good accuracy<br><br>Here is a quick correlation chart <a href=\"https://t.co/EKdrFPAiqS\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/EKdrFPAiqS</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/fb5475fe26008a35f7b6a8476ac265e7.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7c16f1e54e9ae5a53762a86f8348f22a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1867221181440405940","display_date":"December 12, 2024 · 14:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/fb5475fe26008a35f7b6a8476ac265e7.png","/archive/twitter/media/7c16f1e54e9ae5a53762a86f8348f22a.jpg"]}
