{"id":"twitter:1866577117053333732","tweet_id":"1866577117053333732","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1866577117053333732","title":"Weiss was pressured? took a data set of 90,000 Burisma tweets collected over few months and then, after segmenting data, found almost 9,000 unique acc","summary":"Weiss was pressured? took a data set of 90,000 Burisma tweets collected over few months and then, after segmenting data, found almost 9,000 unique accounts sharing MAGA/russian propaganda. Homophily suggested four nodes with a tight central node connecting to other three https://t.co/ckj0iTL9qr","date":"2024-12-10","published":"2024-12-10T20:13:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1866559469313986948","reply_tweet_id":"1866559469313986948","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Weiss was pressured? <br><br> took a data set of 90,000 Burisma tweets collected over  few months and then, after segmenting  data, found almost 9,000 unique accounts sharing MAGA/russian propaganda.<br><br>Homophily suggested four nodes with a tight central node connecting to other three <a href=\"https://t.co/ckj0iTL9qr\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ckj0iTL9qr</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/99e4ec972c074a984ca9db839caf6346.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1866577117053333732","display_date":"December 10, 2024 · 20:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/99e4ec972c074a984ca9db839caf6346.jpg"]}
