{"id":"twitter:1866094805375172621","tweet_id":"1866094805375172621","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1866094805375172621","title":"@JBelcourt73 I think you are underestimating Syria's role and Tartus. Syria was essential in russisn pipeline diplomacy. Now without Tartus, Turkey co","summary":"@JBelcourt73 I think you are underestimating Syria's role and Tartus. Syria was essential in russisn pipeline diplomacy. Now without Tartus, Turkey controls all russian access to Balkan nations and russia can't get supplies into Africa. Anything that furthers the collapse helps Ukraine.","date":"2024-12-09","published":"2024-12-09T12:17:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JBelcourt73/status/1866091361868398836","reply_tweet_id":"1866091361868398836","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JBelcourt73 I think you are underestimating Syria&#x27;s role and Tartus.<br><br>Syria was essential in russisn pipeline diplomacy.<br><br>Now without Tartus, Turkey controls all russian access to Balkan nations and russia can&#x27;t get supplies into Africa.<br><br>Anything that furthers the collapse helps Ukraine.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1866094805375172621","display_date":"December 09, 2024 · 12:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
